{
  "translated_term": "Sui-ji-kok-bo̍k",
  "translation_rationale": "Sui-ji-kok-bo̍k tī koan-li̍p sû-hoat bo̍k-lí hong-bîn chham-siong he kè-pēng sû-hoat bo̍k-lí, chhut-hiān tī sû-hoat sû-koaⁿ siōng, phah-tshûn bîn-chú sû-hoat sû-khek."
