  "translation_rationale": "Ighiyad n tgelda tamaḍayt n igr amenzwit, ṣuḥba n uẓemmawal n ugadir. Iqbalen ad ur iggar aṭas tamazight tiẓri n uẓemmawal, id yili wihad akrur d Tamḍinṭit n Uẓemmawal."
